From 637aca810127da9c9a78c87caa3de1ab152da698 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Huiwen He <hehuiwen@kylinos.cn>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 10:46:17 +0800
Subject: [RFC PATCH v2 4/8] ksmbd: send READ payloads with MSG_SPLICE_PAGES

TCP copies READ payloads after the filesystem has filled the response
buffer.

Read eligible responses into refcounted pages and send them with bvec
iterators and MSG_SPLICE_PAGES. Try a whole-response allocation without
reclaim, then fall back to small folios or base pages. Retain copying for
allocation or layout failures and short reads that would pin an oversized
folio.

Validated the module build, short READs, allocation failure fallback and
page lifetime. Short fio comparisons covered 64KiB/1MiB READs with 1/4
channels.

Signed-off-by: Huiwen He <hehuiwen@kylinos.cn>
